    "text": "etvnews.com\nwebsite\nPrice\nParkdale Health & Rehab Expresses Deep Gratitude for a Community Collaboration and Generous Donation from Bill’s Home Furnishings\n9 hours ago\nPrice, Utah June 19, 2025 Parkdale Health & Rehab is proud to recognize and extend heartfelt thanks to our incredible community partners at Bill’s Home Furnishings. It has been a fantastic collaboration, and we are thrilled to be the recipient of their generous donation of a brand-new Lazy Boy Vail Rocking Recliner.\n2",
